{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"story_grabds_set_1_story_1","storyGroup":"story_grabds_set_1","storySort":0,"storyDependence":null,"storyCanShow":0,"storyCode":null,"storyName":"旧梦重温","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"挡在路上的牧兽开口说话，一朵乌云跳出车斗，路过的神仙帮它们相见相认——这是小满听来的故事，现在她将这个故事讲给孩子们听。","storyCanEnter":0,"storyTxt":"obt/memory/story_grabds_1_1","avgTag":"幕间","unLockType":"STAGE_CLEAR","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":0,"requiredStages":null,"characters":["小满","调皮的孩子","胆小的孩子","年轻的农夫","拦路的驮兽","？？？","路过的小姑娘","拦路的牧兽","满怀期待的孩子们","听故事的孩子们","路过的神仙","迷路的乌云兽","温柔的声音"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"stopmusic","id":1},{"type":"dialog","id":2},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":3},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":4},{"type":"charslot","id":5},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8a/Avg_bg_bg_black.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":6},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_calm_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":7,"musicid":0},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":8},{"type":"text","text":"风很慢很慢地吹过来，吹到身上的时候，就像个调皮的小朋友一样摇你的袖子。","id":9},{"type":"text","text":"它带来很多新奇的气味跟你分享：油菜籽被榨出金色的油，稻秸被扎成捆摞在一起，米粒在锅里翻滚出热气......","id":10},{"type":"text","text":"于是你就知道了这片田野里正在发生的一切。","id":11},{"type":"dialog","id":12},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_wind","id":13},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_grass","delay":"0.8","id":14},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":15},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/34/Avg_bg_38_g20_skyblue_L1.png","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":16},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":17},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":18},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":19},{"type":"charslot","id":20},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小满","text":"黍姐姐说，她这趟从大荒城来罗德岛时，就经过了这样一片田野。","id":21},{"type":"dialogue","name":"调皮的孩子","text":"是麦田吗？","id":22},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小满","text":"不光是麦田。还有稻子、高粱和野草。好多我叫不上来名字的花花草草，都长得好高好高。","id":23},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小满","text":"从这片田野中，伸出一条窄窄的土路来。刚下过雨，地上全是烦人的泥坑。","id":24},{"type":"dialogue","name":"胆小的孩子","text":"不，小满，不要下雨。","id":25},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小满","text":"好，那就换成晴天好了。","id":26},{"type":"dialog","id":27},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/51/Avg_bg_53_g16_sunnyday_R2.png","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":28},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":29},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_brdchrp","volume":"1","id":30},{"type":"dialogue","name":"胆小的孩子","text":"晴天，小虫子和小羽兽也会开心，叽叽喳喳地叫。","id":31},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小满","text":"没错，太阳把草地晒得暖烘烘的，那些耐不住热的小虫子，全都躲到路边的树荫里了。","id":32},{"type":"dialog","id":33},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":34},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a0/Avg_bg_bg_outcounty.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":35},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","isblock":"true","id":36},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":37},{"type":"dialogue","name":"胆小的孩子","text":"这样的天气，好舒服......","id":38},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小满","text":"是不是已经想打个盹了？别忘了你们答应我的哦，听完这个故事，就要乖乖去睡觉了。医生们也说过了，一定要保证充足的睡眠才行哦。","id":39},{"type":"dialogue","name":"调皮的孩子","text":"小满小满，那你呢，你不去睡吗？你还要等黍姐姐吗？","id":40},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小满","text":"她今天有好多事要做，肯定不会来了。等你们睡着了，我也会赶紧休息的，我可不想把自己拖成重感冒。","id":41},{"type":"dialogue","name":"胆小的孩子","text":"小满小满，你接着讲呀——我们保证会听话的。","id":42},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小满","text":"......这时候，从远处跑来一辆车子，车斗里装满了刚收下来的粮食，顶上还盖着一层厚厚的稻草。","id":43},{"type":"dialogue","name":"调皮的孩子","text":"为什么要盖一层稻草？","id":44},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小满","text":"因为驾驶这辆车的年轻农夫，急着将粮食运送到粮站去。他担心粮食在路上被雨淋了，就给粮食盖上一层稻草被子。","id":45},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小满","text":"可是他还是很担忧......","id":46},{"type":"dialog","id":47},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_303_1#1$1","focus":"m","duration":"1","id":48},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":49},{"type":"dialogue","name":"年轻的农夫","text":"这大晴天的，怎么总是有朵乌云跟着我？","id":50,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_npc_303_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_303_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":51},{"type":"dialogue","name":"年轻的农夫","text":"不行，我得再开快点儿，要是雨落下来......","id":52,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_npc_303_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":53},{"type":"charslot","id":54},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"10","ystrength":"12","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":55},{"type":"playsound","key":"$drift","volume":"0.6","id":56},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":57},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_303_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":58},{"type":"dialogue","name":"年轻的农夫","text":"哎哟！","id":59,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_npc_303_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":60},{"type":"charslot","id":61},{"type":"dialogue","name":"胆小的孩子","text":"出什么事了？小满......","id":62},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小满","text":"别怕，没人受伤。只是他刚转过拐角，就发现前面的路被堵住了。","id":63},{"type":"dialog","id":64},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1163_1#1$1","focus":"all","duration":"2","id":65},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1244_1#1$1","focus":"all","duration":"2","id":66},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":67},{"type":"charslot","id":68},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_303_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":69},{"type":"dialogue","name":"年轻的农夫","text":"喂！这牧兽和驮兽是谁家的，快来人把它们牵走！","id":70,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_npc_303_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_303_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":71},{"type":"dialogue","name":"年轻的农夫","text":"喂——","id":72,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_npc_303_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":73},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小满","text":"没人理他。","id":74},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小满","text":"他走近一看，驮兽的脖子上没有缰绳，耳朵上也没有钉标签。牧兽倒是套着鞍具，但他再怎么使劲也拽不动这头牧兽。","id":75},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小满","text":"头顶的乌云越来越近，年轻的农夫急得挠头。他忽然有了主意，到车斗里抓出一把稻草......","id":76},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_303_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":77},{"type":"dialogue","name":"年轻的农夫","text":"给，好吃的！过来就给你吃！","id":78,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_npc_303_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_303_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":79},{"type":"dialogue","name":"年轻的农夫","text":"嘬嘬嘬——","id":80,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_npc_303_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1163_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":81},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拦路的驮兽","text":"......","id":82,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6e/Avg_avg_npc_1163_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":83},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小满","text":"动物也不搭理他！","id":84},{"type":"dialogue","name":"调皮的孩子","text":"那该怎么办？","id":85},{"type":"dialogue","name":"胆小的孩子","text":"它们为什么要挡在路上不走呢？","id":86},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_303_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":87},{"type":"dialogue","name":"年轻的农夫","text":"怎么办？！要是下雨了我这一车粮就全报销了！","id":88,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_npc_303_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_303_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":89},{"type":"dialogue","name":"年轻的农夫","text":"等等，这不会是什么劫道的套路吧？难道树荫里还躲着人？","id":90,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_npc_303_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":91},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小满","text":"他想多了。","id":92},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_303_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":93},{"type":"dialogue","name":"年轻的农夫","text":"快走呀！吁！驾！","id":94,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_npc_303_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_303_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":95},{"type":"dialogue","name":"年轻的农夫","text":"我车里好像有条鞭子，以前在草甸子里拿来开路用的。","id":96,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_npc_303_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_303_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":97},{"type":"dialogue","name":"年轻的农夫","text":"......","id":98,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_npc_303_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":99},{"type":"dialogue","name":"胆小的孩子","text":"小满......","id":100},{"type":"text","text":"年轻的农夫取出鞭子，犹豫着。驮兽和牧兽安静地看着他，没有害怕，也没有动。","id":101},{"type":"text","text":"乌云慢慢飘过来。","id":102},{"type":"text","text":"鞭子被高高举起——","id":103},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":104},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"住手！","id":105},{"type":"dialog","id":106},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","volume":"0.9","id":107},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4122_grabds_1#8$1","focus":"m","duration":"1.5","id":108},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":109},{"type":"dialogue","name":"路过的小姑娘","text":"快住手！我有办法把他们弄走！","id":110,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d5/Avg_avg_4122_grabds_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":111},{"type":"dialogue","name":"调皮的孩子","text":"小满！你怎么跑到故事里去了？","id":112},{"type":"charslot","id":113},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小满","text":"这不是我，这只是一个恰巧路过的小姑娘，嗯！我只是......扮演一下她。","id":114},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4122_grabds_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":115},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小满","text":"这么乖巧的牧兽，这么安分的驮兽，怎么忍心用鞭子抽他们呢？","id":116,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d5/Avg_avg_4122_grabds_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_303_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":117},{"type":"dialogue","name":"年轻的农夫","text":"那你说，你有什么办法？","id":118,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_npc_303_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4122_grabds_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":119},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小满","text":"这简单，让我来劝劝他们，这种事情我可有经验了。","id":120,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/89/Avg_avg_4122_grabds_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_303_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":121},{"type":"dialogue","name":"年轻的农夫","text":"你能跟动物说话？","id":122,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_npc_303_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4122_grabds_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":123},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小满","text":"那当然！","id":124,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7a/Avg_avg_4122_grabds_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":125},{"type":"charslot","id":126},{"type":"text","text":"恰巧路过的小姑娘走到拦路的动物身边，忽地凑近，仔细聆听。","id":127},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_303_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":128},{"type":"dialogue","name":"年轻的农夫","text":"喂，你这小孩——","id":129,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_npc_303_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4122_grabds_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":130},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小满","text":"嘘！","id":131,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/92/Avg_avg_4122_grabds_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_303_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":132},{"type":"dialogue","name":"年轻的农夫","text":"你听出什么了？","id":133,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_npc_303_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4122_grabds_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":134},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小满","text":"......什么都没听到。","id":135,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cf/Avg_avg_4122_grabds_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1244_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":136},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拦路的牧兽","text":"哞？","id":137,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c9/Avg_avg_npc_1244_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4122_grabds_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":138},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小满","text":"我、我听不懂他们说话了！","id":139,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2f/Avg_avg_4122_grabds_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":140},{"type":"charslot","id":141},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":142},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_976_1#1$1","focus":"m","posfrom":"-50,0","posto":"0,0","duration":"1","id":143},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":144},{"type":"dialogue","name":"调皮的孩子","text":"喂喂，小满——！","id":145,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/53/Avg_avg_npc_976_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"调皮的孩子","text":"你耍赖！怎么讲故事还把自己也讲进去了？你又不在那里！","id":146,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/53/Avg_avg_npc_976_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4122_grabds_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":147},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小满","text":"都说了那不是我，是个碰巧路过的小姑娘而已。我猜呀，她应该是附近的学生。","id":148,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7a/Avg_avg_4122_grabds_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_976_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":149},{"type":"dialogue","name":"调皮的孩子","text":"那你说，她叫什么名字？黍姐姐给你讲的时候，也有这个人吗？","id":150,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/53/Avg_avg_npc_976_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4122_grabds_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":151},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小满","text":"......问题真多！","id":152,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7d/Avg_avg_4122_grabds_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小满","text":"你现在不也进故事里面来了？那你又是什么呢？","id":153,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7d/Avg_avg_4122_grabds_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_976_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":154},{"type":"playsound","key":"$leaveshake","volume":"0.6","id":155},{"type":"dialogue","name":"调皮的孩子","text":"我是一棵树！看，哗啦啦！朝你头上撒叶子！","id":156,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/53/Avg_avg_npc_976_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":157},{"type":"charslot","id":158},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_045","focus":"m","posfrom":"50,0","posto":"0,0","duration":"1","id":159},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":160},{"type":"dialogue","name":"胆小的孩子","text":"小满小满，你真的能听懂动物说话吗？","id":161,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/57/Avg_avg_npc_045.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4122_grabds_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":162},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小满","text":"当然是真的。我以前给你们讲了那么多故事，总不能都是我一个人编出来的吧？","id":163,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7a/Avg_avg_4122_grabds_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_045","focus":"m","id":164},{"type":"dialogue","name":"胆小的孩子","text":"那，故事里那个刚好路过的姐姐，她也能听懂吗？","id":165,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/57/Avg_avg_npc_045.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"胆小的孩子","text":"还有......我也能听懂吗？","id":166,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/57/Avg_avg_npc_045.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4122_grabds_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":167},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小满","text":"这个嘛，我倒是问过许多人，黍姐姐，笨水牛，还有博士......答案嘛......","id":168,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/92/Avg_avg_4122_grabds_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":169},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_976_1#1$1","focus":"all","id":170},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_045","focus":"all","id":171},{"type":"dialogue","name":"满怀期待的孩子们","text":"是什么？","id":172},{"type":"charslot","id":173},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4122_grabds_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":174},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小满","text":"嘿嘿，只要有心，就能听懂！","id":175,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c4/Avg_avg_4122_grabds_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4122_grabds_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":176},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小满","text":"虽说，有些动物脾气很倔，一开始不愿意和人交流。","id":177,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/89/Avg_avg_4122_grabds_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4122_grabds_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":178},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小满","text":"但只要弄清楚他们想做什么，就能听懂他们在说什么了！","id":179,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/89/Avg_avg_4122_grabds_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_303_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":180},{"type":"dialogue","name":"年轻的农夫","text":"弄清楚它们想做什么？","id":181,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_npc_303_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4122_grabds_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":182},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小满","text":"对！","id":183,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/89/Avg_avg_4122_grabds_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_303_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":184},{"type":"dialogue","name":"年轻的农夫","text":"真别和我开玩笑了！","id":185,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_npc_303_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_303_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":186},{"type":"dialogue","name":"年轻的农夫","text":"我这一车粮食都是大荒城培育出的新品种，要是泡了雨，粮站的老头会扒了我的皮的！","id":187,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_npc_303_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4122_grabds_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":188},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小满","text":"大荒城，大荒城？对呀！","id":189,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7a/Avg_avg_4122_grabds_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":190},{"type":"charslot","id":191},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1244_1#1$1","focus":"m","duration":"1","id":192},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":193},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小满","text":"你看这只牧兽脖子上挂的号牌！这是一只从大荒城来的牧兽！","id":194,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c9/Avg_avg_npc_1244_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"年轻的农夫","text":"好像......还真是。大荒城离这儿可远了，它是怎么跑到这里来的？","id":195,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c9/Avg_avg_npc_1244_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小满","text":"欸，我认得你。我记得你那时怀孕了，跟在一群牧兽的最后面，慢悠悠地吃草晒太阳。","id":196,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c9/Avg_avg_npc_1244_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小满","text":"你的身上，怎么有了这么多伤口......你的孩子呢？走丢了？","id":197,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c9/Avg_avg_npc_1244_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1244_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":198},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拦路的牧兽","text":"......哞。","id":199,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c9/Avg_avg_npc_1244_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":200},{"type":"text","text":"牧兽低下了头。沉默的驮兽朝她挪近了一步，他们依偎在一起。","id":201},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4122_grabds_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":202},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小满","text":"你，是来找你们的孩子的吗？","id":203,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/89/Avg_avg_4122_grabds_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4122_grabds_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":204},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小满","text":"别担心，我会帮你一起找的。你能告诉我那是个什么样的孩子吗？","id":205,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/89/Avg_avg_4122_grabds_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1244_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":206},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拦路的牧兽","text":"......","id":207,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c9/Avg_avg_npc_1244_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1244_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":208},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拦路的牧兽","text":"它是个善良的孩子。","id":209,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c9/Avg_avg_npc_1244_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_303_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":210},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":211},{"type":"dialogue","name":"年轻的农夫","text":"......！","id":212,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_npc_303_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":213},{"type":"dialogue","name":"听故事的孩子们","text":"真的说话了！","id":214},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1244_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":215},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拦路的牧兽","text":"它的眼睛很大，很圆，我们就叫它圆圆。","id":216,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c9/Avg_avg_npc_1244_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1244_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":217},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拦路的牧兽","text":"大多数时间，它不哭也不闹，紧紧跟着我们。","id":218,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c9/Avg_avg_npc_1244_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1244_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":219},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拦路的牧兽","text":"它的腿发抖，但还是一步一步跟上来。它是个很坚强的孩子。","id":220,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c9/Avg_avg_npc_1244_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4122_grabds_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":221},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小满","text":"圆圆和你们......长得像吗？","id":222,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/89/Avg_avg_4122_grabds_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1244_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":223},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拦路的牧兽","text":"很像。但用你们的眼睛来看的话，一点儿也不。","id":224,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c9/Avg_avg_npc_1244_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1244_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":225},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拦路的牧兽","text":"它是那么小，那么讨人喜欢......它坐在我们的肩上时，总是轻轻地用爪子扣着肩头，它不想弄疼我们。","id":226,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c9/Avg_avg_npc_1244_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4122_grabds_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":227},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小满","text":"可是，可是，那孩子是怎么走丢的呢？","id":228,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2f/Avg_avg_4122_grabds_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1244_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":229},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拦路的牧兽","text":"那不怪它......","id":230,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c9/Avg_avg_npc_1244_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1244_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":231},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拦路的牧兽","text":"我们不得不离开。","id":232,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c9/Avg_avg_npc_1244_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4122_grabds_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":233},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小满","text":"离开大荒城？为什么呢？如果是为了寻找口感更新鲜的牧草，跑到河岸边也就够了呀。","id":234,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2f/Avg_avg_4122_grabds_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1244_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":235},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拦路的牧兽","text":"......","id":236,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c9/Avg_avg_npc_1244_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1244_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":237},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拦路的牧兽","text":"我们沿着路一直走。有的山上和河流里没有路，我们就踩在石头上踏过去。","id":238,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c9/Avg_avg_npc_1244_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1244_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":239},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拦路的牧兽","text":"但我们的孩子，它在路上跟丢了。","id":240,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c9/Avg_avg_npc_1244_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1163_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":241},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拦路的驮兽","text":"......","id":242,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6e/Avg_avg_npc_1163_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4122_grabds_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":243},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小满","text":"......","id":244,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/06/Avg_avg_4122_grabds_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_303_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":245},{"type":"dialogue","name":"年轻的农夫","text":"所以现在是要找到那个幼崽，你们才肯挪窝是吗？","id":246,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_npc_303_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_303_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":247},{"type":"dialogue","name":"年轻的农夫","text":"但是从大荒城一直到这儿，这么远的路，要找多久才能找完？","id":248,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_npc_303_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_303_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":249},{"type":"dialogue","name":"年轻的农夫","text":"你们看那朵乌云，说不定什么时候雨就哗啦啦淋下来了！","id":250,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_npc_303_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_303_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":251},{"type":"dialogue","name":"年轻的农夫","text":"你倒是也说句话呀，小姑娘！","id":252,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_npc_303_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4122_grabds_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":253},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小满","text":"你们......能不能先把路让开，让他过去？我可以留下来帮你们找孩子。","id":254,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/06/Avg_avg_4122_grabds_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1244_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":255},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拦路的牧兽","text":"不能。这是出于另外的原因。","id":256,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c9/Avg_avg_npc_1244_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_303_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":257},{"type":"dialogue","name":"年轻的农夫","text":"唉！！","id":258,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_npc_303_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4122_grabds_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":259},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小满","text":"那只驮兽，为什么一直不说话？他不也是来找孩子的吗？","id":260,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2f/Avg_avg_4122_grabds_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1244_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":261},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拦路的牧兽","text":"同样的原因......你还没弄清的原因。所以它还不会和你说话。","id":262,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c9/Avg_avg_npc_1244_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":263},{"type":"charslot","id":264},{"type":"text","text":"年轻的农夫蹲在地上，歪着脑袋看向那朵越来越低的乌云。阴影罩着树木、道路、驮兽、牧兽和人。","id":265},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小满","text":"欸，你们已经困了吗？要不今天先讲到这里？","id":266},{"type":"dialogue","name":"调皮的孩子","text":"才不要！我就是听入神了！","id":267},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小满","text":"嘘，小声点，那边的弟弟妹妹们刚睡着了。","id":268},{"type":"dialogue","name":"胆小的孩子","text":"小满，你悄悄告诉我好不好？那个走丢的孩子，会是什么样子呢？","id":269},{"type":"dialogue","name":"胆小的孩子","text":"把我带到罗德岛的医生姐姐说，我的眼睛随我妈妈......那只幼崽也会长得像它的爸爸妈妈吗？","id":270},{"type":"dialogue","name":"调皮的孩子","text":"牧兽都能说人话了，那它生的孩子长什么样子都有可能——反正是在讲故事啦，不要管那么多。","id":271},{"type":"dialogue","name":"胆小的孩子","text":"就要管！就要管！","id":272},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小满","text":"嘘——你们还想不想听后面的故事啦？我保证，你们一会儿就知道那只幼崽长什么样子了。","id":273},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_303_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":274},{"type":"dialogue","name":"年轻的农夫","text":"你在那自言自语什么呢？你不是说你有办法搞定吗？","id":275,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_npc_303_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4122_grabds_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":276},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小满","text":"我正在想办法呀。按理说，她就是这时候出现的......再等等好了。","id":277,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/92/Avg_avg_4122_grabds_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_303_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":278},{"type":"dialogue","name":"年轻的农夫","text":"等什么？这老天下雨可不等人！","id":279,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_npc_303_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4122_grabds_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":280},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小满","text":"再等等！","id":281,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/92/Avg_avg_4122_grabds_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_303_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":282},{"type":"dialogue","name":"年轻的农夫","text":"你要是没办法，我还是去拿鞭子......实在对不住了！","id":283,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_npc_303_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4122_grabds_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":284},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小满","text":"她来了，等到了！你看那边！","id":285,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7a/Avg_avg_4122_grabds_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":286},{"type":"charslot","id":287},{"type":"text","text":"从路的那头，走来一位神仙。","id":288},{"type":"text","text":"她手中捏着几棵稗子，裤脚上似乎还沾着些泥点。","id":289},{"type":"dialog","id":290},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2025_shu_1#18$1","focus":"m","duration":"1.5","id":291},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":292},{"type":"dialogue","name":"路过的神仙","text":"你们是要往粮站去吗？","id":293,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/aa/Avg_avg_2025_shu_1-18$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_303_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":294},{"type":"dialogue","name":"年轻的农夫","text":"对，对！眼看就要下雨了，我得赶紧走，可神仙你看，这......","id":295,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_npc_303_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2025_shu_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":296},{"type":"dialogue","name":"路过的神仙","text":"你说那朵乌云吗？别担心，雨落不下来的。","id":297,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/79/Avg_avg_2025_shu_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2025_shu_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":298},{"type":"dialogue","name":"路过的神仙","text":"你也不必着急赶路了......前面的路已经塌了。","id":299,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/38/Avg_avg_2025_shu_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_303_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":300},{"type":"dialogue","name":"年轻的农夫","text":"路塌了？怎么回事，这季节又没有山洪。","id":301,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_npc_303_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2025_shu_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":302},{"type":"dialogue","name":"路过的神仙","text":"所以更难提防。许是前几年山体开裂的旧伤，到今天终于撑不住了。","id":303,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/38/Avg_avg_2025_shu_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2025_shu_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":304},{"type":"dialogue","name":"路过的神仙","text":"......你们拦在这里，倒是救了他一命呢。","id":305,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/79/Avg_avg_2025_shu_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1244_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":306},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拦路的牧兽","text":"哞。","id":307,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c9/Avg_avg_npc_1244_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4122_grabds_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":308},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小满","text":"你们......知道前面的路会塌？","id":309,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2f/Avg_avg_4122_grabds_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1244_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":310},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拦路的牧兽","text":"嗯。","id":311,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c9/Avg_avg_npc_1244_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4122_grabds_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":312},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小满","text":"这就是另外一个原因？","id":313,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7a/Avg_avg_4122_grabds_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1244_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":314},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拦路的牧兽","text":"一部分。我们要帮的人不止他一个。","id":315,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c9/Avg_avg_npc_1244_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1163_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":316},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拦路的驮兽","text":"......","id":317,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6e/Avg_avg_npc_1163_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1244_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":318},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拦路的牧兽","text":"没错。既然你们已经知道了前路的危险，我们该走了。","id":319,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c9/Avg_avg_npc_1244_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4122_grabds_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":320},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小满","text":"等一等！我不是已经弄清另一个原因了吗？为什么他还是不肯和我说话？","id":321,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2f/Avg_avg_4122_grabds_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1244_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":322},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拦路的牧兽","text":"有的话不必说，也能听懂。","id":323,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c9/Avg_avg_npc_1244_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":324},{"type":"charslot","duration":"2","id":325},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_pcknmrn","volume":"0.3","id":326},{"type":"delay","time":"5.5","id":327},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4122_grabds_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":328},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小满","text":"......","id":329,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d5/Avg_avg_4122_grabds_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_303_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":330},{"type":"dialogue","name":"年轻的农夫","text":"它们......这就走了？","id":331,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_npc_303_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":332},{"type":"charslot","id":333},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","volume":"1","id":334},{"type":"text","text":"农夫一拍脑袋，钻进车斗里抓出一大把粮食，朝着驮兽和牧兽追过去。","id":335},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_303_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":336},{"type":"dialogue","name":"年轻的农夫","text":"等一等！谢谢你们！","id":337,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_npc_303_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_303_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":338},{"type":"dialogue","name":"年轻的农夫","text":"呼——呼，为什么，它们看着走得很慢，我却追不上？","id":339,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_npc_303_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2025_shu_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":340},{"type":"dialogue","name":"路过的神仙","text":"走了就追不上了，世事如此，不必遗憾。","id":341,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/38/Avg_avg_2025_shu_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2025_shu_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":342},{"type":"dialogue","name":"路过的神仙","text":"你看，那朵乌云也散去了。我没骗你吧？","id":343,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/79/Avg_avg_2025_shu_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":344},{"type":"charslot","id":345},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":346},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5a/Avg_bg_53_g16_sunnyday_R1.png","screenadapt":"showall","fadetime":"3","id":347},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":348},{"type":"text","text":"乌云消失无踪，阳光填补了空缺。","id":349},{"type":"text","text":"年轻的农夫撑着膝盖气喘吁吁，手里的粮食抓得很紧，没有漏下一颗。","id":350},{"type":"text","text":"忽然，从车斗里传来一阵急促的声响。一只小兽探出脑袋，随后腾的一下跳出车斗，像一朵乌云。","id":351},{"type":"text","text":"它似乎刚睡醒，下意识地从身上抖落一大把杂乱的稻草，完全没弄清自己是怎么到这里来的。","id":352},{"type":"dialog","id":353},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":354},{"type":"charslot","id":355},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":356},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a0/Avg_bg_bg_outcounty.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":357},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":358},{"type":"delay","time":"1","text":"","id":359},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"0,30","focus":"m","id":360},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_599_1#1$1","afrom":"0","ato":"1","focus":"m","duration":"1","id":361},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":362},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迷路的乌云兽","text":"......！","id":363,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d7/Avg_avg_npc_599_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_599_1#1$1","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"0,30","focus":"m","id":364},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迷路的乌云兽","text":"我闻到了爸爸妈妈的味道！它们在哪？","id":365,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d7/Avg_avg_npc_599_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":366},{"type":"charslot","id":367},{"type":"text","text":"小乌云兽绕着车子转了好几圈，好几次跳起来。","id":368},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_599_1#1$1","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"0,30","focus":"m","id":369},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迷路的乌云兽","text":"爸爸妈妈呢？这是哪里？","id":370,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d7/Avg_avg_npc_599_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4122_grabds_1#7$1","posfrom":"30,0","posto":"0,0","focus":"m","duration":"0","id":371},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小满","text":"你是......圆圆？","id":372,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2f/Avg_avg_4122_grabds_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_599_1#1$1","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"0,30","focus":"m","duration":"0","id":373},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迷路的乌云兽","text":"你认识我？不对，你很面熟，我见过你？","id":374,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d7/Avg_avg_npc_599_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4122_grabds_1#7$1","posfrom":"30,0","posto":"0,0","focus":"m","duration":"0","id":375},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小满","text":"你为什么会在车斗里？","id":376,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2f/Avg_avg_4122_grabds_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_599_1#1$1","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"0,30","focus":"m","duration":"0","id":377},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迷路的乌云兽","text":"我也不知道，我就是趁着太阳很好，在稻草堆里睡了一觉。","id":378,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d7/Avg_avg_npc_599_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迷路的乌云兽","text":"一觉醒来，爸爸妈妈就不见了！可我明明闻到了它们的味道！","id":379,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d7/Avg_avg_npc_599_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4122_grabds_1#1$1","posfrom":"30,0","posto":"0,0","focus":"m","duration":"0","id":380},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小满","text":"他们刚刚的确在这里！还没走远，你看！","id":381,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7a/Avg_avg_4122_grabds_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_599_1#1$1","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"0,30","focus":"m","duration":"0","id":382},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迷路的乌云兽","text":"那是......什么？","id":383,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d7/Avg_avg_npc_599_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4122_grabds_1#1$1","posfrom":"30,0","posto":"0,0","focus":"m","duration":"0","id":384},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小满","text":"你的爸爸妈妈呀！","id":385,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7a/Avg_avg_4122_grabds_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_599_1#1$1","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"0,30","focus":"m","duration":"0","id":386},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迷路的乌云兽","text":"啊？","id":387,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d7/Avg_avg_npc_599_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迷路的乌云兽","text":"我......我认不出，我只记得......它们的气味。","id":388,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d7/Avg_avg_npc_599_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4122_grabds_1#7$1","posfrom":"30,0","posto":"0,0","focus":"m","duration":"0","id":389},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小满","text":"认不出？你怎么会认不出来呢？","id":390,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2f/Avg_avg_4122_grabds_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4122_grabds_1#9$1","posfrom":"30,0","posto":"0,0","focus":"m","duration":"0","id":391},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小满","text":"你的眼睛这么圆，就和那只牧兽一模一样。","id":392,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/89/Avg_avg_4122_grabds_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_599_1#1$1","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"0,30","focus":"m","duration":"0","id":393},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迷路的乌云兽","text":"我不记得了！","id":394,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d7/Avg_avg_npc_599_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4122_grabds_1#8$1","posfrom":"30,0","posto":"0,0","focus":"m","duration":"0","id":395},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小满","text":"可是他们还记得......他们说你小时候不哭也不闹，总是跟在爸爸妈妈后面。","id":396,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d5/Avg_avg_4122_grabds_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4122_grabds_1#8$1","posfrom":"30,0","posto":"0,0","focus":"m","duration":"0","id":397},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小满","text":"他们说你连路也走不稳，却还是一步一步坚持往前走。","id":398,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d5/Avg_avg_4122_grabds_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4122_grabds_1#8$1","posfrom":"30,0","posto":"0,0","focus":"m","duration":"0","id":399},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小满","text":"他们说你坐在他们的肩膀上，总是轻轻地用爪子扣着肩头，怕弄疼爸爸妈妈。","id":400,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d5/Avg_avg_4122_grabds_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_599_1#1$1","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"0,30","focus":"m","duration":"0","id":401},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迷路的乌云兽","text":"这是我......这就是我！","id":402,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d7/Avg_avg_npc_599_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":403},{"type":"charslot","id":404},{"type":"text","text":"小乌云兽急得原地转圈，几乎要哭出来。","id":405},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_599_1#1$1","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"0,30","focus":"m","id":406},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迷路的乌云兽","text":"可是我很多年没见过它们了！","id":407,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d7/Avg_avg_npc_599_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4122_grabds_1#7$1","posfrom":"30,0","posto":"0,0","focus":"m","duration":"0","id":408},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小满","text":"那边，你看！那就是你的爸爸妈妈——我带你去找他们，好不好？","id":409,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2f/Avg_avg_4122_grabds_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":410},{"type":"charslot","id":411},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","volume":"1","id":412},{"type":"text","text":"乌云兽跳进小满的怀里。小满吸吸鼻子，朝着火烧云下面的驮兽与牧兽跑去。","id":413},{"type":"text","text":"她一边跑，一边朝他们喊——","id":414},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4122_grabds_1#4$1","posfrom":"30,0","posto":"0,0","focus":"m","duration":"0","id":415},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小满","text":"等一等！","id":416,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/06/Avg_avg_4122_grabds_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4122_grabds_1#4$1","posfrom":"30,0","posto":"0,0","focus":"m","duration":"0","id":417},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小满","text":"我找到你们的孩子了！","id":418,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/06/Avg_avg_4122_grabds_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":419},{"type":"charslot","id":420},{"type":"text","text":"沉默的驮兽似乎听到了她的喊叫，于是停下脚步，转过身等待着。","id":421},{"type":"text","text":"小满加快脚步，想要将小乌云兽带到驮兽面前。","id":422},{"type":"text","text":"可无论她怎么咬牙使劲，她与那只驮兽之间的距离始终没有缩短。","id":423},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_599_1#1$1","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"0,30","focus":"m","id":424},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迷路的乌云兽","text":"没、没用的，你追不上它们。","id":425,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d7/Avg_avg_npc_599_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迷路的乌云兽","text":"它们已经......走了。","id":426,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d7/Avg_avg_npc_599_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":427},{"type":"charslot","id":428},{"type":"text","text":"可那只驮兽，明明就站在那里，一直没有离开。","id":429},{"type":"text","text":"小满没有力气了，她不得不停下来大口喘气。夕阳下每个人的影子都是那么细那么长，像几条永远不会消失的墨痕。","id":430},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2025_shu_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":431},{"type":"dialogue","name":"路过的神仙","text":"交给我吧。","id":432,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e0/Avg_avg_2025_shu_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4122_grabds_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":433},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小满","text":"什么？","id":434,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2f/Avg_avg_4122_grabds_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2025_shu_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":435},{"type":"dialogue","name":"路过的神仙","text":"我会把圆圆送到她的爸爸妈妈面前，我会让圆圆能认出她的爸爸妈妈。","id":436,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e0/Avg_avg_2025_shu_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4122_grabds_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":437},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小满","text":"你，真的是神仙吗？","id":438,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2f/Avg_avg_4122_grabds_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2025_shu_1#12$1","focus":"m","id":439},{"type":"dialogue","name":"路过的神仙","text":"哪里有什么神仙，我们都一样，不过是有心的人罢了。","id":440,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/65/Avg_avg_2025_shu_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2025_shu_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":441},{"type":"dialogue","name":"路过的神仙","text":"你说对吗，恰好路过的小姑娘？","id":442,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/79/Avg_avg_2025_shu_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4122_grabds_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":443},{"type":"dialogue","name":"路过的小姑娘","text":"有心......有心就能听见，就能认出来，是这样吗？","id":444,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/89/Avg_avg_4122_grabds_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4122_grabds_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":445},{"type":"dialogue","name":"路过的小姑娘","text":"那，圆圆就交给你了。","id":446,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/89/Avg_avg_4122_grabds_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2025_shu_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":447},{"type":"dialogue","name":"路过的神仙","text":"放心吧，我保证......","id":448,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/79/Avg_avg_2025_shu_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":449},{"type":"charslot","id":450},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":451},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_303_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":452},{"type":"dialogue","name":"年轻的农夫","text":"你怎么回来了？那个幼崽呢？","id":453,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_npc_303_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4122_grabds_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":454},{"type":"dialogue","name":"路过的小姑娘","text":"交给那位神仙了，她一定会将圆圆送到爸爸妈妈身边的。","id":455,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/89/Avg_avg_4122_grabds_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4122_grabds_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":456},{"type":"dialogue","name":"路过的小姑娘","text":"话说......我可以搭你的车吗？","id":457,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/89/Avg_avg_4122_grabds_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_303_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":458},{"type":"dialogue","name":"年轻的农夫","text":"可以啊，你要去哪？","id":459,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_npc_303_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_303_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":460},{"type":"dialogue","name":"年轻的农夫","text":"反正雨落不下来，我也不必赶时间了。我现在打算往回走，换另一条路去粮站。","id":461,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_npc_303_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4122_grabds_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":462},{"type":"dialogue","name":"路过的小姑娘","text":"那我也去粮站！后面再想别的办法去大荒城。","id":463,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7a/Avg_avg_4122_grabds_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_303_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":464},{"type":"dialogue","name":"年轻的农夫","text":"大荒城，大荒城可远了。说不定路上，你还会再遇到那两只牧兽和驮兽呢！","id":465,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_npc_303_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":466},{"type":"charslot","id":467},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":468},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3d/Avg_bg_44_g13_afterglow_L1.png","screenadapt":"showall","fadetime":"3","id":469},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":470},{"type":"text","text":"路过的小姑娘翻身跳进车斗，摔进厚厚的稻草里面。她头枕着胳膊，注视起天上的云霞来。","id":471},{"type":"text","text":"车辆启动，风吹起来，稻草搔在脸蛋上，痒痒的，但她并不介意。","id":472},{"type":"text","text":"被太阳晒得暖烘烘的稻草，就像牧兽秋后的毛，轻柔地将女孩拥在怀中。","id":473},{"type":"text","text":"女孩感觉自己就像睡在牧兽背上......牧兽，还是驮兽，还是乌云兽？","id":474},{"type":"text","text":"呼——","id":475},{"type":"dialog","id":476},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"4","block":"true","id":477},{"type":"charslot","id":478},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":479},{"type":"playsound","key":"$dooropenquite","volume":"1","id":480},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":481},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","id":482},{"type":"charslot","id":483},{"type":"dialogue","name":"温柔的声音","text":"已经睡着了吗，小满？","id":484},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小满","text":"唔......","id":485},{"type":"charslot","id":486},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小满","text":"神仙......","id":487},{"type":"charslot","id":488},{"type":"dialogue","name":"温柔的声音","text":"被子怎么又掉了。要记得盖好被子呀，这样才会快点好起来。","id":489},{"type":"dialog","id":490},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovement","id":491},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":492},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小满","text":"记得......","id":493},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小满","text":"爸爸妈妈呀......你们要......认得我......","id":494},{"type":"charslot","id":495},{"type":"dialogue","name":"温柔的声音","text":"小满又长高了些，这床被子都快盖不住你了。","id":496},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小满","text":"呼——","id":497},{"type":"charslot","id":498},{"type":"dialogue","name":"温柔的声音","text":"睡吧，小满，做个好梦。","id":499},{"type":"charslot","id":500},{"type":"dialogue","name":"温柔的声音","text":"梦醒之前，我会一直在这里陪着你的。","id":501},{"type":"dialog","id":502},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":503},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"4","id":504},{"type":"character","id":505},{"type":"charslot","id":506},{"type":"image","id":507}],"characters":["小满","调皮的孩子","胆小的孩子","年轻的农夫","拦路的驮兽","？？？","路过的小姑娘","拦路的牧兽","满怀期待的孩子们","听故事的孩子们","路过的神仙","迷路的乌云兽","温柔的声音"]}